@host = http://localhost:3000

### Create an item → 201
POST {{host}}/api/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "found",
  "title": "Black wallet",
  "category": "cards-ids",
  "location": "Library",
  "date": "2026-11-08"
}

### Create with bad data → 400
POST {{host}}/api/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "stolen",
  "title": "",
  "category": "food",
  "date": "banana"
}

### List all items → 200
GET {{host}}/api/items